"火花搭子。聊天有来有往，也容易因为不同想法斗嘴较劲。把想法说清楚，少让对方猜，一起完成个小挑战，让火花变成乐趣。" = "Lively sparks. Different ideas can lead to lively exchanges and a little friendly rivalry. Be clear about what you mean and try a small challenge together to make the sparks fun.";
"火花碰撞。各有主见，聊天容易冒出火花，也可能忍不住较劲。不同意见先说清楚，把争输赢换成一起找有趣的答案。" = "Sparks fly. You both have your own ideas, which can make conversation lively or a little competitive. Explain your differences and explore interesting answers together.";
